---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config.mjs';
---
<PageLayout title="Medical Disclaimer" eyebrow="Important" lastUpdated={SITE.legalLastUpdated} description={`${SITE.name} content is for general information only. It is not medical advice and is not intended to diagnose, treat or cure any condition.`}>
  <h2>General information only</h2>
  <p>
    The content on {SITE.name} — including articles, buying guides, comparisons and product mentions — is provided for
    general informational purposes about sleep comfort and bedroom products. It is not medical advice and is not a
    substitute for advice from a doctor, physical therapist, sleep specialist or other qualified healthcare
    professional.
  </p>

  <h2>No diagnosis or treatment</h2>
  <p>
    We do not diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease or condition. No pillow, mattress, topper or other product
    mentioned on this site is claimed to treat pain, sleep apnea, insomnia, snoring or any other health issue.
  </p>

  <h2>When to talk to a professional</h2>
  <p>
    If you have persistent neck, shoulder, back or hip pain, ongoing trouble falling or staying asleep, loud snoring,
    pauses in breathing during sleep, excessive daytime sleepiness, or any other health concern, please consult a
    qualified healthcare professional. Never ignore professional advice or delay seeking it because of something you
    read here.
  </p>

  <h2>Individual results vary</h2>
  <p>Comfort is personal. A product that feels great to one person may not suit another. Body size, sleep position, preferences and health all play a role.</p>

  <h2>No professional relationship</h2>
  <p>Reading this site or contacting us does not create a doctor–patient or any other professional relationship.</p>
  <p>Questions? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
